<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | Neo-Luxe</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #111827 0%, #000000 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            color: #06b6d4;
        }
        input, textarea {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) !important;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) !important;
        }
        input:focus, textarea:focus {
            border-color: #06b6d4 !important;
            outline: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen">

    
    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
        <section class="text-center mb-24">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight">About Us</h1>
            <p class="text-cyan-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-12">Excellence in precision, beauty in design.</p>
            
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                <h2 class="text-cyan-500 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Our Story</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed italic">
                    Born from a passion for precision and a love for timeless design, Luxe Time was established to bridge the gap between luxury horology and modern accessibility. We believe that a watch is more than just a time-telling device; it is a statement of character, a piece of history, and a companion for life's most significant moments. Our commitment to quality ensures that every piece we curate meets the highest standards of craftsmanship, putting our customers first in every interaction.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-32">
            <h2 class="text-center text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-12">Why Choose Us</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-xl text-center group hover:border-cyan-500/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 feature-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-gem text-xs"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-3">Premium Quality</h3>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Only the finest materials and craftsmanship for every timepiece.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-xl text-center group hover:border-cyan-500/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 feature-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-xs"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-3">Secure Payments</h3>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">100% encrypted transactions for your peace of mind.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-xl text-center group hover:border-cyan-500/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 feature-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast text-xs"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-3">Fast Delivery</h3>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Expedited worldwide shipping with white-glove handling.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-xl text-center group hover:border-cyan-500/50">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 feature-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left text-xs"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-3">Easy Returns</h3>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Complimentary returns within 30 days of purchase.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-32">
            <h2 class="text-center text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-2">Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mb-12">Our specialists are available to assist you.</p>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div class="glass-card p-12 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-center space-y-10">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 feature-icon rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-cyan-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Email Us</p>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold">support@luxetime.com</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Typical response within 24 hours.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 feature-icon rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-cyan-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Call Us</p>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold">+1 (800) 123-4567</p>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-1">Available Mon-Fri, 9am - 6pm EST.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-10 rounded-2xl">
                    <form class="space-y-5">
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold mb-2 block">Full Name</label>
                            <input type="text" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm text-white transition-all">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold mb-2 block">Email Address</label>
                            <input type="email" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm text-white transition-all">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold mb-2 block">Message</label>
                            <textarea rows="4" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm text-white transition-all"></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-black font-bold py-4 rounded-lg text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all">
                            Send Message
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-card p-20 rounded-[2rem] text-center mb-20 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="relative z-10">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto leading-tight uppercase">Discover Timeless Elegance in Our Latest Collection.</h2>
                <a href="/shop" class="inline-block bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-black font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all">
                    Shop Now
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-64 h-64 bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[100px]"></div>
        </section>
    </main>

   

</body>
</html>